cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  qTracer: a CloudCompare plugin for fracture trace and joint
  plane extraction from rock outcrop point clouds
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chiu
    given-names: Chia-Chi (Jate)
    affiliation: >-
      Rock Lab, Institute of Mineral Resources Engineering,
      National Taipei University of Technology
    email: ccchiu@ntut.edu.tw
    # orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/jatestrella/CloudCompare-qTracer'
abstract: >-
  qTracer is a CloudCompare plugin that extracts discrete
  fracture network (DFN) traces and joint planes from
  rock-outcrop point clouds. It provides colour filtering, a
  six-stage extraction pipeline (eigenvector computing,
  cylindrical DBSCAN clustering, lineation, trace clustering,
  plane fitting, coplanar plane merging), trace-length
  filtering, outcrop-area computation, and areal fracture
  intensity (P21).
keywords:
  - discrete fracture network
  - fracture trace extraction
  - point cloud
  - rock mass characterisation
  - CloudCompare plugin
  - P21
